": 0.25758754863813227, "x1": 0.6292629262926293, "y1": 0.26381322957198444}, {"text": "to 3 significant figures.", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.267704280155642, "x1": 0.3146314631463146, "y1": 0.2809338521400778}, {"text": "A cylindrical container closed at both ends is to be made from thin sheet metal. The", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.36186770428015563, "x1": 0.8030803080308031, "y1": 0.37509727626459144}, {"text": "(\u00a9)", "x0": 0.058305830583058306, "y0": 0.36264591439688715, "x1": 0.07920792079207921, "y1": 0.3743190661478599}, {"text": "cm\u2019.", "x0": 0.823982398239824, "y0": 0.38365758754863816, "x1": 0.8591859185918592, "y1": 0.3968871595330739}, {"text": "container is to have a radius 7 cm and a height of h cm such that its volume is 20007", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.3867704280155642, "x1": 0.8173817381738174, "y1": 0.4}, {"text": "(Such a cylinder closed at both ends has surface area $ and volume V given by the", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.41167315175097274, "x1": 0.7920792079207921, "y1": 0.42490272373540855}, {"text": "formulae $ = + and V =", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.43735408560311284, "x1": 0.42794279427942794, "y1": 0.4482490272373541}, {"text": "(i) Find an expression for A in terms of r.", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.4669260700389105, "x1": 0.46644664466446645, "y1": 0.49182879377431904}, {"text": "(ii) Show that the total surface area of metal to be used is (2nr? + secon) cm},", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.5066147859922179, "x1": 0.7645764576457645, "y1": 0.5361867704280155}, {"text": "(iii) Hence, find the minimum area of sheet metal required to make the container.", "x0": 0.12981298129812982, "y0": 0.5540856031128405, "x1": 0.7832783278327833, "y1": 0.5735408560311284}, {"text": "4", "x0": 0.8833883388338833, "y0": 0.5571984435797666, "x1": 0.8932893289328933, "y1": 0.5673151750972762}, {"text": "Answer", "x0": 0.7909790979097909, "y0": 0.5579766536964981, "x1": 0.8525852585258525, "y1"